{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03357","headline":"始安秋日 · 宋之问","name":"始安秋日","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桂林风景异，秋似洛阳春。\n晚霁江天好，分明愁杀人。\n卷云山𧥄𧥄，碎石水磷\n世业事黄老，妙年孤隐沦。\n归欤卧沧海，何物贵吾身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03357.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03357","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}